@step List the registry-declared dependencies for the filing year.
aeat --format json app modelo work dependencies --year 2025
@step Narrow the inventory to one modelo.
aeat --format json app modelo work dependencies --year 2025 --modelo 390
@step Narrow further to one modelo and period, which also evaluates its blockers.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work dependencies --year 2025 --modelo 390 --period 0A
@expect result.filing_year == 2025
@expect exit_code == 0
